+## Normal-item box recipe candidate
+
+October17 source `1f70065` in
+`C:/Users/verre/.codex/worktrees/reforge-normal-items/EQ_Local_Dev` adds three
+identical eligible Normal/Base items to one Polished. Higher costs remain four.
+Legacy inputs require an existing +200000 definition with exact next-quality
+name; hunt inputs use NextTier and require enabled hunt state. Dungeon qualities
+remain separate. ContainerSlots stays four while BoxCopies selects 3/4/4.
+Stack units count individually; charged nonstackables count once each. Binding,
+instance exclusions, all-slot persisted preimages, receipt atomicity and uncertain
+result quarantine remain. Client packet and Veyra messages describe both costs.
