+25 ordinary-tradeskill and ten quest checks pass. Tests first reproduced the
+normal rejection; independent review found no blockers. Dependencies are fakes,
+not live inventory/MariaDB. Full production build, deployment and owner QA remain
+pending in `docs/releases/reforge-normal-20261017/{README,QA}.md`.
+
+Requires a fresh current-runtime zone build and matching Veyra script through
+supported runtime restart, not quest/rule reload alone. No SQL/revision, ItemData
+ABI/cache-content or client asset change. Retain revision2026101201 and current
+signed client/cache; never deploy the October12 frozen builder over newer dungeon
+and journal work. Preserve earned inventory/receipts on recovery. Wiki candidate
+text is committed but unpublished; it does not change the live recipe.
